  "id": "mysql-history",
  "name": "Mysql History - File Disclosure",
  "author": "kazet",
  "severity": "LOW",
  "description": "The mysql_history file is a history file used by the MySQL command-line client (mysql) to store a record of the SQL commands and statements entered by a user during their interactive MySQL sessions. It serves as a command history for the MySQL client, allowing users to recall and reuse previously executed SQL commands.\n",
